// Example integration outline only. Do not import this file or add a gateway
// SDK until a real payment integration is explicitly approved.
//
// Implement the same interface as demoProvider.js:
// - createOrder({ order }): create a gateway order using the server's trusted
//   amountPaise and currency, then return { providerOrderId }.
// - verifyPayment(payload): verify gateway order/payment identifiers and the
//   provider's payment signature using its documented signing scheme.
// - verifyWebhook(rawBody, headers): verify the webhook signature against the
//   exact raw request body before accepting payment/refund events.
//
